cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "Binary cq sources with dimension-independent compression loss"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Answers the binary classical-reference compression question of Wolff et al. negatively by constructing full-rank binary cq sources in unbounded dimensions whose mutual-information loss is bounded away from zero under fixed-dimensional compression. No collective or active setting is addressed."
